{"product_id":"dad-stuff-shedloads-of-ideas-for-dads","title":"Dad Stuff: Shedloads of Ideas for Dads","description":"\u003cp\u003eChildren expect the earth from their fathers. They have to be able to conjure up games from thin air, to answer every question under the sun, to skim stones, and tell bedtime stories. Such perfect dads may exist. For the rest of us, there is DAD STUFF.DAD STUFF is packed with great things to do with kids. Some new, some traditional: how to learn to ride a bike without tears; how to play the spoons; a rainy afternoon's supply of knock knock jokes; a selection of magic tricks and how to answer 'Dad, where do babies come from?' There is a range of ideas to suit all situations -- games, puzzles, practical jokes and spooky urban myths.Not all dads are walking encyclop$ias and DAD STUFF will provide an easily recalled mine of useful and useless information with which kids can amaze their friends. Dads never need to be stuck for ideas again.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 148 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Steve Caplin | Simon Rose\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780743275743\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45199410987161,"sku":"9RG9780743275743","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c9b976c64ca_Dad_20Stuff-_20Shedloads_20of_20Ideas_20for_20Dads_20Steve_20Caplin_20__20Simon_20Rose.jpg?v=1741354625","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dad-stuff-shedloads-of-ideas-for-dads","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}